From d70e00e0fe0e6963e49f9b2df6da86dd81038cad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tunkoal <tunkoal@163.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:08:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Bluetooth: complete LHDC V3 native adapter migration to
 Android 17

The factory referenced the nonexistent V3Source class instead of the retained A2dpCodecConfigLhdcV3. Compiling the full integration set also exposed V3 dispatch before vendor/codec parsing, mixed libbase/libchrome logging macros, and pre-A17 raw-array use after MediaCodecCapabilities became a value object. Move dispatch after parsing and equality validation, use the stack log::assert_that API, and mirror upstream V5 typed snapshot/rollback plus data() serialization access. Preserve failure rollback and fatal invariant checks. Seven ARM64/APEX36 translation units passed using the recorded compiler options with warnings-as-errors. Whitespace passed. Unified IMG, linking and flashed audio validation pending.

