From b20dda8625e7f3b7c901066d8751a39d54784c29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tunkoal <tunkoal@163.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:45:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] LE Audio: fall back after controller rejects asymmetric
 CIG parameters

The existing asymmetric-PHY fallback only handles a remote CIS rejection. On rothko MT6989 with OS3.0.307 vendor firmware, a pure MEDIA stream instead repeatedly fails LE Set CIG Parameters with local status 0x11 before any CIS exists. The audio sender remains READY_TO_START and the user hears silence. Bidirectional LIVE streams can establish both CIS links, although distorted audio was separately reported.

On an unsupported-feature/parameter CIG rejection for unidirectional playback, reuse the existing per-group asymmetric-PHY state so the next normal start attempt uses symmetric PHY. Preserve the existing invalid-status callback and all other failure handling. A device configuration hook for this state does not exist, so the shared state-machine rejection path owns this bounded fallback.

Evidence: work/bluetooth-routing-20261115/lc3-repro/held-no-sound-* and current source fallback in ProcessHciNotifCisEstablished. The asymmetric PHY diagnosis is a hypothesis until device A/B validation. Added a state-machine regression test. Extracted production branch passed four host cases with freestanding host Clang; whitespace check passed. Full native tests, unified build, flash, retry acceptance and distortion/stereo validation remain pending. This candidate does not establish that all LC3 symptoms are resolved.
Change-Id: Idb56e2237e48ba4a5fa51dd9c3a747414cea0898
---
 system/bta/le_audio/state_machine.cc      |  8 ++++++++
 system/bta/le_audio/state_machine_test.cc | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+)

diff --git a/system/bta/le_audio/state_machine.cc b/system/bta/le_audio/state_machine.cc
index 68b5fee54bc12748c9620e1d6ddc7f9b804a5ce7..7af59d1ab4a8478771eb89a5a9cc3fdaf9c332da 100644
--- a/system/bta/le_audio/state_machine.cc
+++ b/system/bta/le_audio/state_machine.cc
@@ -703,6 +703,14 @@ public:
       }
 
       group->cig.SetState(CigState::NONE);
+      // A controller can reject asymmetric PHY parameters before CIS creation,
+      // so the remote-CIS rejection fallback below is never reached.
+      if (status == static_cast<uint8_t>(ErrorCode::UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE_OR_PARAMETER_VALUE) &&
+          group->asymmetric_phy_for_unidirectional_cis_supported &&
+          group->GetSduInterval(bluetooth::le_audio::types::kLeAudioDirectionSource) == 0) {
+        log::info("Controller rejected unidirectional CIG parameters, use symmetric PHY on retry");
+        group->asymmetric_phy_for_unidirectional_cis_supported = false;
+      }
       log::error(", failed to create CIG, reason: 0x{:02x}, new cig state: {}", status,
                  ToString(group->cig.GetState()));
       state_machine_callbacks_->OnStateMachineInvalidStatusCb(
